---
title: Cinnamon Doughnuts
yield: 10%doughnuts
course: Dessert
locale: en
difficulty: Medium
---

= Doughnuts =

Sift together the @self-raising flour{225%g}, @salt{pinch} and @cinnamon{5%tsp}. Rub in the @butter or margarine{25%g} and stir in the @caster sugar{25%g}. Add the @egg{1%large}(beaten) and sufficient @milk{} to mix to a soft dough.

Form into balls about 5cm (2") and place in a preheated deep fat fryer (without basket). Turn a few times and fish out when golden brown (after about ~{3%minutes}.

= Serve =

Drain and toss in @caster sugar{} mixed with @cinnamon.